    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nThis home is a substantial five-bedroom detached family residence situated within the highly regarded Woodfield development off Cappagh Road, a mature residential setting overlooking the woodland surrounding Rusheen Bay. Beautifully maintained and upgraded over the years, this impressive residence offers spacious, well-balanced accommodation designed to meet the needs of family living.\n\nIdeally positioned close to Silver Strand, Barna Woods and Cappagh Sports Grounds, the property also enjoys easy access to a range of excellent schools, shops, cafés and recreational amenities, while both Knocknacarra and Barna Village are just minutes away.\n\nExtending over a generous floor area, the accommodation is bright, welcoming and exceptionally versatile. The ground floor features two spacious reception rooms, providing ample space for family life and entertaining, together with a large kitchen/breakfast room, formal dining room, utility room and guest wc.\n\nUpstairs, there are five generously proportioned bedrooms, four of which benefit from en suite facilities, in addition to a spacious family bathroom. A staircase provides access to a floored attic area, offering valuable additional storage space. The property further benefits from hollow-core flooring between the ground and first floors, enhancing quality and sound insulation throughout the home.\n\nPresented in excellent decorative order and ready for immediate occupation, this home offers a rare opportunity to acquire a spacious family home in one of Galway's most convenient and sought-after residential locations. Viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate the quality, space and setting on offer.\n\nGarden:\nA generous cobble lock driveway to the front of the property provides ample off-street parking for several vehicles. Gated side access leads to the beautifully maintained rear garden, which features a block-built shed extending to approximately 24.5 sq.m. A paved patio area overlooks the raised lawn and mature trees and hedging, creating an ideal setting for outdoor dining."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall: - \nPorch leads to hallway with solid mahogany floors, stairs, doors, skirting and architraves.\n\nSitting Room: - \nSolid mahogany flooring, solid fuel fire with cast iron inset and timber surround, front aspect window.\n\nLiving Room: - \nDouble doors, feature Parque flooring, solid fuel open fire with marble surround and cast iron inset.\n\nDining Room: - \nParque flooring, French patio door to the rear of the house, door to hall and double doors to living room.\n\nKitchen/Breakfast Room: - \nFully integrated solid mahogany kitchen units with built in fridge/freezer, double oven and hob, microwave, granite worktop and splashback, breakfast area, door to utility.\n\nUtility Room: - \nBuilt in storage units, plumbed for washing machine and dryer, guest wc, rear acess door.\n\nLanding: - \nCarpet flooring, stairs to attic. Large shelved hot press.\n\nBedroom 1: - \nMain bedroom with solid maple flooring, ample built in wardrobes and dressing table, large front aspect window.\n\nEn-Suite: - \nPartly tiled with wc, wash hand basin and large shower unit, side aspect window.\n\nBedroom 2: - \nDouble room to the front of the house with carpet flooring, built in wardrobes and front aspect window.\n\nEn-Suite: - \nFully tiled with wc, wash hand basin and shower unit, side aspect window.\n\nBedroom 3: - \nDouble room with maple flooring, built in wardrobes and rear aspect window.\n\nEn-Suite: - \nFully tiled with wc, wash hand basin and shower unit.\n\nBedroom 4: - \nDouble room with maple flooring, built in wardrobes and rear aspect window\n\nEn-Suite: - \nFully tiled with wc, wash hand basin and shower unit, rear aspect window.\n\nBedroom 5: - \nSingle room with carpet flooring, rear aspect window.\n\nBathroom: - \nFully tiled with suite to include corner jacuzzi bath, wc, bidet, wash hand basin and side aspect window.\n\nAttic: - \nAdditional storage space with Velux windows.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Prime location close to Silver Strand and Cappagh Road amenities</li><li>Triple glazed windows</li><li>Hallowcore between ground and first floor</li><li>Walls pumped</li><li>Large detached block built shed</li><li>Off street parking</li><li>South facing to the front</ul>"
      },
